---
import { BUILD_STEPS } from '../../lib/light-explorer/data';
const firstStep = BUILD_STEPS[0];
---
<main id="main-content" class="light-explorer" aria-labelledby="explorer-title">
  <header class="le-topbar"><a href="/" class="le-brand">ELECTRASIM <span>/ EXPERIMENTAL LAB</span></a><div class="le-identity"><span>LIGHT EXPLORER</span><b>1879 · MENLO PARK</b></div><a href="/" class="le-exit">EXIT LAB</a></header>
  <section class="le-stage" aria-label="Interactive Edison lamp laboratory">
    <div class="le-copy"><p class="le-eyebrow">EXPERIMENTAL #001</p><h1 id="explorer-title">The practical incandescent lamp</h1><p>Enter a reconstructed laboratory. Inspect the carbon filament, follow the vacuum, and make the lamp glow.</p><button class="le-primary" id="le-enter">ENTER THE LAB <span>→</span></button></div>
    <div class="le-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="le-canvas" aria-label="Interactive 3D reconstruction of an Edison-style 1879 lamp"></canvas><div class="le-loading" id="le-loading">RECONSTRUCTING LABORATORY…</div><div class="le-hint" id="le-hint">Drag to explore · scroll to zoom</div></div>
    <div class="le-object-label"><span>DOCUMENTED OBJECT</span><strong>Carbon-filament lamp</strong><small>31 DECEMBER 1879 · PUBLIC DEMONSTRATION</small><em id="le-physics-status">SIMULATION · POWER OFF</em><em id="le-build-status">STEP 01 · {firstStep.label} · {firstStep.caption}</em><em id="le-vacuum-status">VACUUM · OPEN TO ATMOSPHERE</em><em id="le-event-status">MENLO PARK · LABORATORY BENCH</em></div>
  </section>
  <nav class="le-controls" aria-label="Lamp view controls"><button class="active" data-mode="assembly">ASSEMBLY</button><button data-mode="cutaway">CUTAWAY</button><button data-mode="disassemble">DISASSEMBLE</button><button data-mode="build">HOW IT WAS BUILT</button><button data-mode="xray">X-RAY</button><button id="le-vacuum">VACUUM PUMP</button><button id="le-demonstration">31 DEC 1879</button><label class="le-voltage">VOLTAGE <input id="le-voltage" type="range" min="0" max="130" value="0" step="1"/><output id="le-voltage-out">0 V</output></label><button id="le-power">POWER OFF</button><button id="le-history">HISTORY</button><button id="le-reset">RESET</button></nav>
  <aside class="le-inspector" id="le-inspector" hidden><button class="le-close" id="le-close" aria-label="Close inspector">×</button><p class="le-eyebrow" id="le-inspector-type">COMPONENT</p><h2 id="le-inspector-title">Carbon filament</h2><p id="le-inspector-copy">Carbonized cotton thread. It becomes incandescent when current passes through its resistance.</p><button class="le-secondary" id="le-isolate">ISOLATE</button></aside>
  <div class="le-history-panel" id="le-history-panel" hidden><button class="le-close" id="le-history-close" aria-label="Close history">×</button><p class="le-eyebrow">HISTORICAL RECORD</p><h2>22 October 1879</h2><p>Edison’s notebook records a carbonized cotton-thread experiment in a vacuum bulb: starting resistance approximately <strong>113 Ω</strong>, later approximately <strong>140 Ω</strong>, with about half-candle-power output.</p><p class="le-source">Historical fact · Edison Papers, Rutgers University</p><div class="le-timeline"><span>1879</span><i></i><span>22 OCT</span><i></i><span>31 DEC</span><i></i><span>1882</span></div></div>
  <section class="le-semantic"><h2>Edison Light Explorer — the 1879 incandescent lamp</h2><p>Explore a historically grounded reconstruction of Edison’s practical incandescent lighting system. The primary object is an Edison-style carbon-filament lamp, not a modern screw-base bulb. Its glass envelope, top vacuum tip, glass stem, platinum clamps, platinum wires, copper conductors and contact plates can be inspected in the interactive laboratory.</p><h3>How the lamp was built</h3><p>Copper wires received platinum sections; a glass stem was blown around the wires; the filament was carbonized and mounted; a glass envelope was fitted, evacuated with a vacuum pump, sealed and life-tested.</p><h3>Historical sources</h3><ul><li><a href="https://www.si.edu/object/edison-new-years-eve-lamp:nmah_995925">Smithsonian Institution — Edison New Year’s Eve lamp</a></li><li><a href="https://edison.rutgers.edu/life-of-edison/biographical-essays/lighting/the-carbon-filament-lamp">Rutgers Edison Papers — The Carbon-Filament Lamp</a></li><li><a href="https://www.nps.gov/parkhistory/online_books/hh/edis/edisc2.htm">National Park Service — Edison Historical Handbook</a></li></ul></section>
</main>
<style>
.light-explorer{--ink:#27312f;--muted:#6f7971;--paper:#f8f4ec;--line:#d9d1c3;position:relative;width:100vw;height:100vh;height:100dvh;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 73% 42%,#fffdf6 0,#f5eee1 42%,#e5d9c7 100%);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-body,system-ui)}.le-topbar{position:absolute;z-index:20;inset:0 0 auto;height:64px;padding:0 34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #cfc5b5aa;background:#fbf8f1d9;backdrop-filter:blur(14px);font:700 11px var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.12em}.le-brand{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}.le-brand span{color:#9b6a35}.le-identity{display:grid;text-align:center;gap:4px}.le-identity b{font-size:9px;color:#9b6a35}.le-exit{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}.le-stage{position:absolute;inset:64px 0 104px;overflow:hidden}.le-copy{position:absolute;z-index:5;top:15%;left:7vw;width:min(360px,34vw)}.le-eyebrow{margin:0 0 13px;color:#a4682f;font:800 10px var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.2em}.le-copy h1{margin:0;font:700 clamp(2.3rem,4.5vw,5.5rem)/.95 var(--font-display,serif);letter-spacing:-.065em}.le-copy>p:not(.le-eyebrow){margin:24px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}.le-primary,.le-secondary{border:1px solid #a66d35;background:#a66d35;color:white;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:3px;font:800 10px var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.12em;cursor:pointer}.le-primary span{margin-left:18px;font-size:16px}.le-canvas-wrap{position:absolute;inset:0}.le-canvas-wrap canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;cursor:grab}.le-canvas-wrap canvas:active{cursor:grabbing}.le-loading{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);color:#986633;font:800 10px var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.2em}.le-hint{position:absolute;bottom:30px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #cdbfae;background:#fffaf1cc;border-radius:99px;color:var(--muted);font:10px var(--font-mono,monospace);transition:opacity .4s}.le-hint.is-hidden{opacity:0}.le-object-label{position:absolute;z-index:4;right:7vw;bottom:8%;display:grid;gap:6px;text-align:right}.le-object-label span,.le-object-label small,.le-object-label em{font:9px var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.14em;color:#98734c}.le-object-label em{font-style:normal;color:#6c8a70}.le-object-label strong{font:700 19px var(--font-display,serif)}.le-controls{position:absolute;z-index:20;bottom:0;inset-inline:0;height:104px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;border-top:1px solid #cfc5b5;background:#fbf8f1e8;backdrop-filter:blur(12px)}.le-controls button{border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 14px;font:800 10px var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.12em;cursor:pointer}.le-voltage{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:#8e5c2e;font:800 9px var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.1em}.le-voltage input{width:90px;accent-color:#a66d35}.le-voltage output{width:34px;color:var(--muted);font-size:9px}.le-controls button:hover,.le-controls button.active{border-color:#b98a59;color:#8e5c2e;background:#fffaf1}.le-inspector,.le-history-panel{position:absolute;z-index:30;right:5vw;top:100px;width:min(330px,86vw);padding:25px;background:#fffaf1f2;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 18px 60px #7355322b}.le-history-panel{left:50%;right:auto;top:17%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:min(520px,86vw)}.le-inspector h2,.le-history-panel h2{margin:4px 0 12px;font:700 28px var(--font-display,serif)}.le-inspector p,.le-history-panel p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.le-close{position:absolute;right:12px;top:10px;border:0;background:none;font-size:24px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}.le-source{font:10px var(--font-mono,monospace)!important;color:#986633!important}.le-timeline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:25px;font:800 10px var(--font-mono,monospace);color:#986633}.le-timeline i{height:1px;flex:1;background:#cbbba7}.le-semantic{position:absolute;left:-10000px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}.light-explorer-body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;background:#f8f4ec}@media(max-width:700px){.le-topbar{padding:0 16px}.le-brand{font-size:9px}.le-identity{font-size:9px}.le-exit{font-size:9px}.le-copy{left:7vw;top:7%;width:70vw}.le-copy h1{font-size:2.6rem}.le-copy>p:not(.le-eyebrow){font-size:13px;margin:12px 0}.le-object-label{right:6vw;bottom:4%;}.le-controls{height:82px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-content:center;padding:8px}.le-controls button{padding:8px 7px;font-size:8px}}
</style>
